<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa JSE mkt cap at record 1,248 bln rand high.</title>
<headline>S.Africa JSE mkt cap at record 1,248 bln rand high.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Johannesburg Stock Exchange said on Monday that market capitalisation on the exchange moved to a fresh high of 1,248 billion rand on Friday, June 6</p>
<p>The previous record of 1,241 billion rand was recorded on June 5.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
